<block wx:if="{{deferred}}"><view class="page">支付功能已预留，待接入方案确定后再启用。</view></block><block wx:else><view class="page"><view>{{appName}} 的支付渠道</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{locked}}">操作结果未知，已锁定写入，请核对后联系管理员。</view><picker range="{{codes}}" value="{{selected}}" bindchange="select"><view class="card">选择渠道：{{codes[selected]}}</view></picker><button bindtap="refresh">重新读取</button><view class="card" wx:if="{{form}}"><view>{{form.id ? '编辑现有渠道' : '新增渠道'}} {{form.code}}</view><view>配置仅供写入，不会读取或显示已保存的密钥。编辑时可输入需要变更的字段；留空的配置字段保留原值。新增时需填写完整配置。</view><input placeholder="渠道费率（%）" type="digit" value="{{form.feeRate}}" data-key="feeRate" bindinput="input"/><input placeholder="备注" value="{{form.remark}}" data-key="remark" bindinput="input"/><radio-group bindchange="status"><label><radio value="0" checked="{{form.status === 0}}"/>启用</label><label><radio value="1" checked="{{form.status === 1}}"/>停用</label></radio-group><textarea placeholder="渠道配置 JSON；编辑可填写变更字段" value="{{form.config}}" data-key="config" bindinput="input" maxlength="-1"/><button wx:if="{{form.id ? canUpdate : canCreate}}" bindtap="save" disabled="{{locked || loading}}">保存渠道</button><button wx:if="{{form.id && canDelete}}" bindtap="remove" disabled="{{locked || loading}}">删除无历史关联渠道</button></view></view>
</block>
